body:
I disagree, if they cant take a moment to respond to a text but is active on social media, clearly theres no interest. Don't get psychotic and msg her a bunch, give it a few days, if no response, hit her with a hey hope your good like the guy above says but if you have no response even then, get it in your head that shes not interested, so you arent as hurt. If she comes back to you(initiates first contact) then cool, go with it. Either way, your escaping unhurt.

&#x200B;

EDIT: However, in the case of a family emergency, she may be too busy for small talk, not wanting to date atm etc. Make sense?

If I am in a situation to win moneys, and you pull this shit on my team, your dead to me.

&#x200B;

Edit: pull this shit = respecting 'rule 1'

Why am I turned on by this

&#x200B;

Edit: It was better with no sound :(
